{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MineDeeper gives Minesweeper a whole new dimension in a fresh and trippy way. Below the field lie an <strong>endless amount of new layers</strong> to solve, that support your run by clearing upper layers for <strong>less 50/50 situations</strong>.<strong>\u00a0</strong>But the deeper you go, the harder it gets: use all layers to your advantage to defuse any roadblock. How deep can you go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104630/extras/f4474c4880d413bdfb24748ecbe7e59a.poster.avif?t=1760704411\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104630/extras/f4474c4880d413bdfb24748ecbe7e59a.webm?t=1760704411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104630/extras/f4474c4880d413bdfb24748ecbe7e59a.mp4?t=1760704411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parallax visuals</strong> give you a better sense of depth and add to this trippy concept (These can be disabled in the options).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The development of MineDeeper has been a hobby of mine for the past couple of years with the result being an experience that I as a Minesweeper enthusiast am very fond of. MineDeeper is great for casual play as well as experienced players and speedrunners. An <strong>in-game timer and scoreboard</strong> keep track of your highscore layer and milestone times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give it a try for yourself and enjoy!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4104630?t=1760704411","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4104630?t=1760704411","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104630/54095a6b904cf7e6e22c2533cd4c52324939897d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760704411","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104630/54095a6b904cf7e6e22c2533cd4c52324939897d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760704411","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MineDeeper gives Minesweeper a whole new dimension in a fresh and trippy way. Below the field lie an <strong>endless amount of new layers</strong> to solve, that support your run by clearing upper layers for <strong>less 50/50 situations</strong>.<strong>\u00a0</strong>But the deeper you go, the harder it gets: use all layers to your advantage to defuse any roadblock. How deep can you go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104630/extras/f4474c4880d413bdfb24748ecbe7e59a.poster.avif?t=1760704411\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104630/extras/f4474c4880d413bdfb24748ecbe7e59a.webm?t=1760704411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104630/extras/f4474c4880d413bdfb24748ecbe7e59a.mp4?t=1760704411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parallax visuals</strong> give you a better sense of depth and add to this trippy concept (These can be disabled in the options).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The development of MineDeeper has been a hobby of mine for the past couple of years with the result being an experience that I as a Minesweeper enthusiast am very fond of. MineDeeper is great for casual play as well as experienced players and speedrunners. An <strong>in-game timer and scoreboard</strong> keep track of your highscore layer and milestone times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give it a try for yourself and enjoy!</p>","developers":["Jace"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104630/90df48ba762c8f845db5c5d5098eb681c77e84ae/header.jpg?t=1760704411","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104630/112393905/cbf813f947d01a2efb8e1c87b77541ee977c5068/1760196484/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760694462","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104630/112393905/cbf813f947d01a2efb8e1c87b77541ee977c5068/1760196484/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760694462","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104630/112393905/cbf813f947d01a2efb8e1c87b77541ee977c5068/1760196484/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760694462","id":257216108,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216108/movie480.mp4?t=1760694462","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216108/movie_max.mp4?t=1760694462"},"name":"MineDeeper Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257216108/265ae32a0a9a30d9f302742dfa8b4c0f5c36fbda/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760694462","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216108/movie480.webm?t=1760694462","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216108/movie_max.webm?t=1760694462"}}],"name":"MineDeeper","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Low requirements<br></li><li><strong>Graphics